1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,934
The iodine soaked chains conduct electricity along their length.

2
00:00:04,934 --> 00:00:11,822
So they soak up the part of the electric field that vibrates along them, and let through the part vibrating across them.

3
00:00:11,822 --> 00:00:14,596
That direction is the transmission axis.

4
00:00:14,596 --> 00:00:20,494
Two sheets are used together: the first is the polarizer, the second the analyser.

